are we in terms of getting that line and again, it can be a CNA or can be the industry?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/29/cna-financial-corp-cna-q1-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CNA 2019 Q1","e":"cna","d":"2019-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James M. Anderson","x":"The underlying loss ratio was 62.1%, including about a 0.5 point of severance expense related to actions taken within the claim department as we reorganized to better manage our loss adjustment expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/29/cna-financial-corp-cna-q1-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CNA 2019 Q1","e":"cna","d":"2019-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Meyer Shields","x":"Is there any way of quantifying the savings associated with the severance in claims in the first quarter?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/29/cna-financial-corp-cna-q1-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CNA 2019 Q2","e":"cna","d":"2019-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jay Cohen","x":"And what are the average price increases you're achieving now, probably varies quite a bit by state, by product, but can you give us a sense of what they are?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/cna-financial-corp-cna-q2-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CNA 2019 Q3","e":"cna","d":"2019-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dino Ennio Robusto","x":"I'm pleased to share our third quarter results with you today, which reflect continued good underwriting performance, accelerated price increases and strong growth across our US operation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/cna-financial-corp-cna-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CNA 2019 Q3","e":"cna","d":"2019-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dino Ennio Robusto","x":"The sustainability of price increases is further validated when you place it against the backdrop of an exceedingly protracted low interest rate environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/cna-financial-corp-cna-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CNA 2019 Q4","e":"cna","d":"2020-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dino E. Robusto","x":"I'm pleased to share our fourth quarter and full-year results with you today, which reflect continued strong underwriting performance, accelerated price increases and robust growth across our US operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/10/cna-financial-corp-cna-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CNA 2020 Q1","e":"cna","d":"2020-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dino E. Robusto","x":"Our first quarter results continued to reflect strong underwriting performance, accelerated price increases and robust growth in our US operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/cna-financial-corp-cna-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CNA 2020 Q3","e":"cna","d":"2020-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dino E. Robusto","x":"As I have said on prior calls, our strategy has been to simultaneously make substantial investments in talent, technology and analytics to position us for sustained success while streamlining our operation in order to keep our overall underwriting expenses flat.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/02/cna-financial-corp-cna-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CNA 2021 Q1","e":"cna","d":"2021-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dino E. Robusto","x":"…operates, it's consistently competitive with an underwriting cycle defined by long periods where price increases do not cover long run loss cost trends that compound annually, like the roughly 20 plus quarters prior to this hardening market phase were at through the first quarter of this year,…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/03/cna-financial-corp-cna-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CNA 2021 Q2","e":"cna","d":"2021-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dino E. Robusto","x":"And we believe that med mal price increases will persist at the double-digit level through year-end.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/cna-financial-corporation-cna-q2-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNA 2021 Q2","e":"cna","d":"2021-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dino E. Robusto","x":"And notwithstanding a 1 point moderation in price increases in the first and second quarters, we are securing strong written rate increases where needed most.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/cna-financial-corporation-cna-q2-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNA 2021 Q3","e":"cna","d":"2021-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dino E. Robusto","x":"Gross written premium, excluding our captive business grew by 10% this quarter, fueled by excellent new business growth and continued strong price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/01/cna-financial-corporation-cna-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNA 2021 Q3","e":"cna","d":"2021-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dino E. Robusto","x":"And the supply chain issues creating higher cost of labor and materials are partially offsetting the benefit of the price increases, leading to a greater awareness that additional rate is required in property for a longer period of time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/01/cna-financial-corporation-cna-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNA 2022 Q2","e":"cna","d":"2022-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dino Robusto","x":"We saw that in the data and increased our accident year loss ratio fix considerably, which led us to start raising prices very early on at the expense of retention.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/01/cna-financial-cna-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends"